            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Khosraviani, Bijan  and Levitt, Raymond E.. (2004). WP085: Organization Design Optimization Using Genetic Programming. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: http://purl.stanford.edu/py346cr6785",
